      "message": "This addresses a couple of the issues that were raised in my previous attempt to fix this issue.\n* java_sdk_library does the right thing out of the box.\n* it avoids the need for a separate metalava invocation to generate docs compatible stubs sources.\n* it only affects the public API stubs so minimizes the impact on build time.\n\nWhile this does reverse some of the changes made in https://r.android.com/1255866 it should not affect the performance test describe in that change (touching frameworks/base/core/java/android/view/View.java and building framework) as the framework code is not compiled by java_sdk_library.\n\nOnce this change has been approved in AOSP I need to cherry pick to rvc-dev to fix the issue with the public Javadoc and SDK. See the bug for more details.",
